  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Maximum voltage that can be measured by this potentiometer will be equal to potential drop across <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ohm</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>120</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>"
